.container(style="padding-top: 90px; padding-bottom: 40px")
  h2 Spherical Sliceform — 3D sandbox
  p.text-muted
    | Phase 0/1 proof-of-concept. Pick a polyhedron to see its edges as great-circle
    | arcs, or a great-circle arrangement to build an interlocking strip sphere:
    | crossings are marked (green = simple pair, red = multi-way junction) and the
    | flattened cutting strips can be exported as SVG. Drag to orbit, scroll to zoom.

  .form-inline(style="margin: 15px 0")
    .form-group
      label(style="margin-right: 8px") Model
      select#modelSelect.form-control
        optgroup(label="Polyhedron edges")
          option(value="solid:tetrahedron") Tetrahedron
          option(value="solid:cube") Cube
          option(value="solid:octahedron") Octahedron
          option(value="solid:icosahedron") Icosahedron
          option(value="solid:dodecahedron") Dodecahedron
        optgroup(label="Great-circle sliceform")
          option(value="gc:ortho3") 3 orthogonal circles
          option(value="gc:ico6") 6 great circles (icosahedral)
          option(value="gc:ico10") 10 great circles (icosahedral)
          option(value="gc:ico15", selected) 15 great circles (icosahedral)
          option(value="gc:ico31") 31 great circles (icosahedral)
        optgroup(label="Spherical pattern (Islamic motif)")
          option(value="pat:cube") Cube — star motif
          option(value="pat:octahedron") Octahedron — star motif
          option(value="pat:icosahedron") Icosahedron — star motif
          option(value="pat:dodecahedron") Dodecahedron — star motif
    label.checkbox-inline(style="margin-left: 20px")
      input#showSphere(type="checkbox", checked)
      |  Show sphere
    label.checkbox-inline(style="margin-left: 12px")
      input#showCrossings(type="checkbox", checked)
      |  Show crossings

  #patPanel(style="margin: 10px 0; display: none")
    p#patStats.text-muted(style="margin-bottom: 10px")
    .form-inline
      .form-group(style="margin-right: 15px")
        label(style="margin-right: 6px") Star skip
        input#skip.form-control(type="number", value="2", min="1", max="6", step="1", style="width: 70px")
      .form-group(style="margin-right: 15px")
        label(style="margin-right: 6px") Strip width (mm)
        input#patStripHeight.form-control(type="number", value="14", min="2", max="40", step="1", style="width: 80px")
      .form-group(style="margin-right: 15px")
        label(style="margin-right: 6px") Radius (mm)
        input#patRadius.form-control(type="number", value="80", min="20", max="300", step="5", style="width: 85px")
      .form-group(style="margin-right: 15px")
        label(style="margin-right: 6px") Cut strip into
        select#patSplit.form-control(style="width: 110px")
          option(value="1") 1 arc
          option(value="2", selected) 2 arcs
          option(value="3") 3 arcs
      label.checkbox-inline(style="margin-right: 15px")
        input#colorByStrip(type="checkbox")
        |  Colour by strip
      button#patExportBtn.btn.btn-primary
        i.fa.fa-download
        |  Export cutting strips (SVG)
    p.text-muted(style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px")
      | Each face carries an {n/skip} star (e.g. skip 2 = pentagram); the chords cross
      | to form the slots and the lines are traced into continuous strips across the
      | sphere (each colour = one strip). Every strip develops to a curved annular
      | sector; it is cut open into arcs to be woven together.

  #sphereCanvas(style="width: 100%; height: 560px; background: #f7f7f7; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px")

  #gcPanel(style="margin-top: 15px")
    p#stats.text-muted(style="margin-bottom: 10px")
    .form-inline
      .form-group(style="margin-right: 15px")
        label(style="margin-right: 6px") Strip width (mm)
        input#stripHeight.form-control(type="number", value="8", min="2", max="40", step="1", style="width: 80px")
      .form-group(style="margin-right: 15px")
        label(style="margin-right: 6px") Sphere radius (mm)
        input#radius.form-control(type="number", value="80", min="20", max="300", step="5", style="width: 90px")
      .form-group(style="margin-right: 15px")
        label(style="margin-right: 6px") Cut each ring into
        select#splitCount.form-control(style="width: 140px")
          option(value="1") 1 open ring
          option(value="2", selected) 2 half-circles
          option(value="3") 3 arcs
          option(value="4") 4 arcs
      button#exportBtn.btn.btn-primary
        i.fa.fa-download
        |  Export cutting strips (SVG)
    p.text-muted(style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px")
      | Each ring is a curved annular piece (mean radius = sphere radius, width =
      | strip width) — not a straight strip. Closed rings can't be assembled (every
      | pair of great circles is linked), so each is cut into open arcs that weave
      | together. Blue = cut outline; black = radial interlocking slot (half-depth,
      | alternating outer/inner edge). Labels are ring.arc.

  script(src="bower/three/three.min.js")
  script(src="bower/three/OrbitControls.js")
  script(src="js/sphere/geometry.js")
  script(src="js/sphere/pattern.js")
  script(src="js/sphere/patternstrips.js")
  script(src="js/sphere/spike.js")
